 smoke; every 0.6 s they flare, the body flashes white then orange, scorch marks spread. |\n| Charmed | `status/charmed` | loop 2.4s | 60×76 | Smitten: a big heart beats over the head, throwing a ring and a flush of light with every beat, little hearts float up, the eyes go pink and the cheeks blush. |\n| Confused | `status/confused` | loop 2.4s | 60×78 | Head in a spin: a glowing spiral whirls over the head, question marks pop up round it and bob, the eyes dart left and right. |\n| Cursed | `status/cursed` | loop 2.4s | 64×84 | Hexed: violet smoke rises off the body in winding trails, a dark stain creeps up from the feet with a glowing edge, the eyes burn, a skull glitches in overhead. |\n| Frozen | `status/frozen` | loop 2s | 72×64 | Chilled to the bone: frost ferns creep over the body, icicles hang from chin and hands and drip, breath steams, snow settles, a shiver every second, frost spreads underfoot. |\n| Haste | `status/haste` | loop 1.2s | 100×56 | Sped up: striped after-images stream out behind, speed lines whip past, dust kicks off the heels and the leading edge catches the wind. Faces right. |\n| Petrified | `status/petrified` | one-shot 3.8s | 120×74 | Turned to stone: grey creeps up from the feet behind a crackling edge that spits grit, the statue holds, cracks run through it, and it bursts into tumbling chunks and dust. |\n| Poisoned | `status/poisoned` | loop 1.6s | 72×64 | Sick to the bone: green rolls up the body in waves, dark veins creep from a wound, toxic sweat drips and hisses; every 0.8 s it wobbles, blisters pop and a ring pulses out. |\n| Rage | `status/rage` | loop 1.2s | 80×80 | Seething: the body judders on every heartbeat, an anger mark throbs at the temple, eyes burn, steam jets off the head, stress lines flash out and the floor cracks hot underfoot. |\n| Sleep | `status/sleep` | loop 2.4s | 60×82 | Fast asleep: eyes shut, soft outlined Zs float up off the head one after another, swaying and growing as they rise, dream motes drift, a slow breathing glow. |\n| Slowed | `status/slowed` | loop 2.4s | 64×76 | Dragged through time: a glassy clock dial behind the head ticks round in heavy steps, flashing with each, while drops sink in slow motion and spread slow rings. |\n| Stunned | `status/stunned` | loop 2s | 60×64 | Seeing stars: three spinning stars and two little birds circle the head on a tilted ring, ducking behind it and sweeping round in front, trailing glitter. |\n\n## nature\n\npoison, vines, thorns, quakes.\n\n| effect | id | | size | what it does |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| Acid splash | `nature/acid-splash` | one-shot 2.8s | 184×116 | A gob of acid bursts into a crown and spatters; it eats a glowing, smoking pit into the floor and boils down into it, spitting bright beads, pale steam curling off. |\n| Boulder | `nature/boulder` | one-shot 2.3s | 264×120 | A spinning boulder arcs right shedding dust and pebbles, smashes into the floor in a white flash and bursts into tumbling chunks, gravel and rolling dust. |\n| Earth spike | `nature/earth-spike` | one-shot 3.4s | 272×150 | The floor cracks with light and heaves, a faceted stone spike rams up with two side shards in a burst of chips, grit and dust; rubble rains, then it splits and crumbles. |\n| Healing bloom | `nature/healing-bloom` | one-shot 3.3s | 124×120 | A sprout pushes up and unfurls, a bud swells and opens round a glowing golden heart in a flare of healing light; its petals lift away one by one as motes. |\n| Leaf storm | `nature/leaf-storm` | loop 2.4s | 112×104 | Leaves tumble up a rising spiral round the character, passing behind and in front, turning and flipping, wrapped in bright bands of wind; litter swirls at their feet. |\n| Poison cloud | `nature/poison-cloud` | loop 4s | 256×100 | A miasma hugging the floor: ragged sheets of gas lit yellow-green from within, fading to violet, creep out in tongues that curl over at their tips; plumes twist up as ribbons. |\n| Quake | `nature/quake` | one-shot 3.1s | 288×104 | The ground jolts three times: a rift tears out along the floor glowing deep inside, slabs of floor heave up and drop back askew, pebbles hop and dust bursts out of the split. |\n| Root snare | `nature/root-snare` | one-shot 2.7s | 128×96 | The floor cracks and roots burst up round the character, spiralling round its legs; they cinch tight with a snap, hold, then crack and crumble into bark and dust. |\n| Spore burst | `nature/spore-burst` | one-shot 3.2s | 212×132 | A toadstool pushes up, swells and trembles as its gills glow, then squashes and puffs a lumpy cloud of glowing spores that billows up and drifts down twinkling. |\n| Thorns | `nature/thorns` | one-shot 2.4s | 232×92 | A seam races along the floor and hooked thorns punch up out of it one after another, each bigger than the last, in bursts of dirt and green light; they hold, then sink. |\n| Tornado | `nature/tornado` | loop 2s | 196×168 | A snaking funnel of spinning wind bands under a flared, churning top that flickers with lightning; leaves and debris whirl round it front and back, dust boils at its foot. |\n| Toxic puddle | `nature/toxic-puddle` | loop 4s | 176×100 | Black tar lit from inside by chartreuse veins and a glowing rim, an oily sheen drifting on it; glossy bubbles dome, stretch and pop, vapour curls up in fraying ribbons. |\n| Vine whip | `nature/vine-whip` | one-shot 1.4s | 216×128 | A thorny vine bursts from the floor, rears back coiled, then lashes out right in a whip crack that sprays sap and tears off leaves, before sliding back into the ground. |\n\n## weather\n\nrain, snow, fog, aurora.\n\n| effect | id | | size | what it does |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| Aurora | `weather/aurora` | loop 12s | 320×180 | Rippling curtains of green-to-violet light over a starfield: folding hems burn bright, rays shimmer up into violet, and the whole sky slowly breathes. |\n| Blizzard | `weather/blizzard` | loop 8s | 320×180 | Snow driven almost flat by a gale: streaks at three depths race past, gusts throw translucent sheets of snow across the sky and spindrift streams off the drifts. |\n| Cherry blossoms | `weather/cherry-blossoms` | loop 10s | 320×180 | Pink petals flutter down on a spring breeze, tumbling in little spirals and flashing as they catch the light, with a few whole blossoms spinning among them. |\n| Clouds | `weather/clouds` | loop 12s | 320×180 | Layers of clouds drift past a bright moon at night: silver-lit tops, dark bellies, edges that flare where they cross the moon, forming and thinning as they go. |\n| Falling leaves | `weather/falling-leaves` | loop 10s | 320×180 | Autumn leaves swing down through the air, tilting and flipping to show their pale backs, ride a gust, land flat in the litter and fade. |\n| Fireflies | `weather/fireflies` | loop 12s | 320×180 | Fireflies wander over a meadow at night, each glowing up and fading on its own rhythm, trailing light and lighting the grass tips beneath them. |\n| Fog | `weather/fog` | loop 12s | 320×180 | Slow banks of moonlit fog at three depths drift past each other, crests catching the light, while thin streaks of mist slide by in front. |\n| God rays | `weather/god-rays` | loop 10s | 320×180 | Shafts of light slant down from high on the left, breathing and swaying, pooling on the floor, as drifting dust motes light up whenever they cross a beam. |\n| Rain | `weather/rain` | loop 8s | 320×180 | Slanted rain at four depths: far drops fade into the dark, near ones glint and splash, drops ring the puddles and a low mist drifts over the wet floor. |\n| Shooting stars | `weather/shooting-stars` | loop 10s | 320×180 | Meteors burn across a starry sky, white heads trailing gold and rose; the big ones flare and break up, and each leaves a glowing train that twists and fades. |\n| Snow | `weather/snow` | loop 12s | 320×180 | Snow at three depths in a gusty breeze: far specks, drifting flakes, big near crystals that spin and glow; they settle on a sparkling drift and melt away. |\n| Storm | `weather/storm` | loop 10s | 320×180 | Driving rain at two depths under a churning cloud deck; a forked bolt strikes in a double flash that lights the sky and the rain, then sheet lightning glows in the clouds. |\n\n## ui\n\nlevel ups, numbers, toasts, countdowns.\n\n| effect | id | | size | what it does |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| Achievement | `ui/achievement` | one-shot 2.4s | 220×72 | A toast slides in on speed lines and settles; a gold medal pops onto it in a burst of sparkles, a shine sweeps the whole toast, then it slides away. |\n| Coin collect | `ui/coin-collect` | one-shot 2.45s | 176×116 | A coin bursts into a fountain of spinning coins that hang, then zip one by one into a HUD counter that pops and ticks up, glints and folds away. |\n| Combo counter | `ui/combo-counter` | one-shot 1.45s | 208×100 | x5 COMBO rockets in on streaming speed lines, smearing, and slams to a stop: a white flash, a ring, sparks; it pulses while a timer bar drains, then whooshes out. |\n| Confetti | `ui/confetti` | one-shot 3.4s | 200×140 | Two party poppers bang one after the other: paper bits and curly streamers burst out, stall, then tumble and flutter down, flipping, and settle on the floor. |\n| Countdown | `ui/countdown` | one-shot 3.1s | 152×136 | 3, 2, 1 slam into a timer ring that drains like a burning fuse, throwing sparks; then GO! bursts out as the ring blows into a shockwave with rays. |\n| Crit number | `ui/crit-number` | one-shot 1.5s | 152×120 | CRIT 128! slams in huge and white over a jagged starburst with a hard shake and speed lines, cools to fire, holds with a shine, then pops into sparks. |\n| Damage number | `ui/damage-number` | one-shot 1.05s | 76×68 | A red -27 punches out of a hit spark, white for a frame, arcs up, lands with a squash and a little hop, then fades as it lifts away. |\n| Exclamation | `ui/exclamation` | one-shot 1.4s | 84×104 | A bold ! springs up off the hero's head, stretching as it shoots up and squashing as it lands; surprise ticks flick out, it wobbles, then pops away. |\n| Health bar hit | `ui/health-bar-hit` | one-shot 2s | 160×64 | A segmented health bar takes a hit: it jolts and dips, the lost chunk flashes white and sheds chips, holds, then drains away behind a sparking edge. |\n| Heart lost | `ui/heart-lost` | one-shot 1.5s | 96×88 | A HUD heart is hit: it flashes white and jolts, a crack runs down it, it splits into two halves that tumble away, leaving an empty socket that fades. |\n| Level up | `ui/level-up` | one-shot 3.2s | 176×138 | Gold gathers at the feet and bursts up as a pillar of light round the hero; rings climb it, LEVEL UP! drops in letter by letter, a shine sweeps it, sparkles twinkle. |\n| Quest complete | `ui/quest-complete` | one-shot 2.6s | 204×92 | A stitched ribbon unrolls from the middle, QUEST COMPLETE types on letter by letter, a gold seal stamps down and ticks, stars pop; then it all rolls away. |\n\n## pickups\n\ncoins, gems, chests, potions.\n\n| effect | id | | size | what it does |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| Chest open | `pickups/chest-open` | one-shot 4.6s | 176×112 | A banded chest rattles with gold light leaking from its seam, the lid kicks open, rays fan up, and coins and gems arc out, bounce, glint and get collected. |\n| Coin spin | `pickups/coin-spin` | loop 1.6s | 56×56 | A thick gold coin turning on its edge: an embossed star face, a reeded rim showing as it goes edge-on, a flash sweeping the face, bobbing over its shadow. |\n| Collect burst | `pickups/collect-burst` | one-shot 1.35s | 112×108 | The moment of pickup: a white flash and a cross of light, a thin ring snapping out ahead of a softer one, twinkles thrown wide on curving paths that brake, hang and wink out. |\n| Crystal shard | `pickups/crystal-shard` | loop 3.2s | 64×76 | A broken amber shard hovers and sways: chipped uneven faces, its top sheared off, light pulsing up through glowing cracks and flaring out of the break; splinters orbit it. |\n| Gem spin | `pickups/gem-spin` | loop 2.4s | 64×64 | A brilliant-cut ruby turning on its axis: real facets catch the light in turn, flashes roll over the crown, refracted light slides across the floor, sparkles wink round it. |\n| Heart pickup | `pickups/heart-pickup` | loop 1.2s | 56×60 | A plump glossy heart hovering over its shadow beats lub-dub: a big squash and stretch, a smaller echo, light and a thin ring pulsing out, tiny hearts drifting off. |\n| Key glint | `pickups/key-glint` | loop 2s | 72×60 | An ornate silver key hovering and rocking; a glint runs from its bow down the shaft to the teeth and bursts off the tip as falling sparks. |\n| Loot beam | `pickups/loot-beam` | loop 2.4s | 96×176 | A dropped sword in a tall pillar of rarity light: a white core thinning to the sky, rings pulsing across the floor, motes streaming up, a glint racing up the shaft. |\n| Potion | `pickups/potion` | loop 2.4s | 56×72 | A round glass flask of glowing brew rocks in the air: the brew sloshes behind the rock, bubbles rise and pop, light glows through the glass, wisps curl off the cork. |\n| Power star | `pickups/power-star` | loop 1.6s | 88×84 | A fat bevelled star rocks side to side and swells on each beat, rays of light turning slowly behind it, sparks spinning off its points. |\n| XP orb | `pickups/xp-orb` | loop 1.8s | 72×56 | A small glowing orb races a figure-eight, a comet tail tapering behind it along its path, flecks shed from the tail winking out, its light following it over the floor. |\n\n## transitions\n\nwipes, irises, dissolves.\n\n| effect | id | | size | what it does |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| Blinds | `transitions/blinds` | one-shot 2s | 320×180 | Slats catch the light edge-on, then tilt shut top to bottom, lit rims glinting as warm light squeezes through the closing gaps with dust in it; then they tilt open and fade. |\n| Burn away | `transitions/burn-away` | one-shot 3s | 320×180 | The screen burns in from its edges behind a ragged ember line of licking flames, embers and smoke; then the black smoulders and burns open from the middle. |\n| CRT off | `transitions/crt-off` | one-shot 2s | 320×180 | The picture squeezes into a white-hot glowing line, the line into a dot that lingers as a fading afterglow; then it switches back on, dot to line to picture, with a warm-up glow. |\n| Diamond wipe | `transitions/diamond-wipe` | one-shot 2s | 320×180 | A wave of faceted diamonds swells across the screen, rims bright and ridges lit, cooling to black as they lock; then they rise as gems again and shrink away with glints. |\n| Glitch wipe | `transitions/glitch-wipe` | one-shot 1.8s | 320×180 | Torn bands of black stutter across the screen, freezing and jerking back, their ragged edges split into magenta and cyan ghosts spitting data slivers; then they tear on through. |\n| Iris | `transitions/iris` | one-shot 2.2s | 320×180 | A lit iris closes onto a warm spotlight where dust drifts, holds as its rim twinkles, snaps shut into a glint, then pops open from a flash with a white-hot rim throwing sparks. |\n| Pixel dissolve | `transitions/pixel-dissolve` | one-shot 2.2s | 320×180 | Clumps of blocks wink in, each drawn in a white outline that fills black and cools, with glints; then they wink out, outlines collapsing, the last small ones sparkling away. |\n| Shatter wipe | `transitions/shatter-wipe` | one-shot 2.8s | 320×180 | A dark glass pane drops over the screen and bounces; cracks race out from an impact with a flash, then it bursts into tumbling glass shards with lit edges that fall away. |\n| Slash wipe | `transitions/slash-wipe` | one-shot 1.7s | 320×180 | A white-hot blade edge slices across the screen, light ahead of it and sparks spraying back over the cover; a second cut flashes through and the cover splits apart. |\n| Star iris | `transitions/star-iris` | one-shot 2.2s | 320×180 | A five-point star iris spins shut on the middle of the screen, its gold rim lit and its tips twinkling and shedding motes; it closes on a glint and spins open again from a flash. |\n\n## critters\n\nslimes, bats, ghosts, frogs.\n\n| effect | id | | size | what it does |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| Bat | `critters/bat` | loop 2.4s | 112×80 | A bat flaps in four snappy wing frames along a figure-eight, its body lifting on each downbeat, moonlight on its wing bones, red eyes glowing and glinting. |\n| Bird | `critters/bird` | loop 2.4s | 112×80 | A songbird flies in place: bursts of wingbeats that lift its body on each downstroke, a glide on spread wings, its tail fanning, a loose feather drifting away. |\n| Butterfly | `critters/butterfly` | loop 3.2s | 128×88 | An iridescent butterfly wanders a loop in bursts of quick wingbeats and open-winged glides, its veined, spotted wings shedding a twinkling trail of glowing dust. |\n| Eyeball | `critters/eyeball` | loop 3.2s | 96×108 | A bloodshot eyeball floats in its fleshy lids: its glowing iris snaps from one look to the next, it blinks, and its nerve sways behind it as it bobs. |\n| Fish school | `critters/fish-school` | loop 4.8s | 136×80 | A school of fish holds station in two depth rows: bodies wag into swinging tails, one darts ahead now and then, bubbles rise and caustic light ripples over them. |\n| Flying skull | `critters/flying-skull` | loop 2.4s | 96×132 | A cracked bone skull bobs in the air, jaw chattering, eyes burning, a fire roaring off its crown that sheds flame puffs, embers and smoke and throws warm light. |\n| Frog | `critters/frog` | loop 2.6s | 112×88 | A frog puffs its throat, blinks, crouches and leaps to snap a buzzing fly out of the air, then lands with a squash and a puff of dust, gulps and settles. |\n| Ghost | `critters/ghost` | loop 2.4s | 96×100 | A sheet ghost bobs over the floor: its scalloped hem ripples and trails its drift, little arms flutter, it glances about and blinks, motes trickle off its hem. |\n| Jellyfish | `critters/jellyfish` | loop 3.2s | 96×120 | A see-through jellyfish pulses: its bell squeezes to shove it up and relaxes as it sinks, frilled arms and long tentacles trailing, a glow inside, bubbles drifting by. |\n| Slime | `critters/slime` | loop 1.8s | 112×88 | A glossy slime hops in place: it squashes to wind up, stretches into the jump, rounds out in the air, splats down flinging droplets that creep back, then wobbles and blinks. |\n| Snake | `critters/snake` | loop 2.4s | 136×56 | A snake slithers along the floor, head raised: humps rise and roll back down its patterned body to the tail, dust puffs where it touches down, its forked tongue flicks. |\n| Wisp | `critters/wisp` | loop 3.2s | 128×104 | A will-o'-the-wisp loops a figure-eight over the floor: a little soul-flame with a face, its flame tail licking up and streaming behind, shedding puffs and sparks. |\n"
 },
