ething went wrong. \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n\n Uh oh!\n \n There was an error while loading. Please reload this page . \n \n\n \n \n \n \n No results found \n \n \n \n View all tags \n \n \n \n \n\n \n \n\n \n \n \n \n github-actions \n\n released this\n\n \n 29 Oct 06:10\n \n \n\n \n\n\n \n \n \n \n v10.3.0\n \n \n \n \n \n 5de343d \n \n \n \n\n \n \n\n \n \n \n \n \n This commit was created on GitHub.com and signed with GitHub’s verified signature .\n \n \n\n\n \n GPG key ID: B5690EEEBB952194 \n \n \n Verified\n \n \n Learn about vigilant mode .\n \n \n \n \n\n \n\n \n \n 10.3.0 (2026-10-29) \n\n Summary \n This release adds support for the OTP-Token header from the IETF draft draft-goto-otp-token , which lets mail clients and browsers offer a one-time passcode for autofill on the site it belongs to. It also fixes how a Content-ID header is encoded. \n Who should upgrade \n \n Anyone sending one-time passcodes by email who wants them to be machine-readable. \n Anyone already setting an OTP-Token header through headers : before this release it went out MIME encoded and could not be parsed. \n Anyone embedding images with a cid that holds a non-ASCII character or a quote. \n \n Highlights \n \n New otp message option: otp: { code: '123456', origin: 'https://example.com' } adds OTP-Token: \"123456\"; origin=\"https://example.com\" . The origin is reduced to its canonical form, only https (or http on a loopback host) is accepted, and invalid values fail the send with the new EOTP error code. See Message configuration . \n A custom OTP-Token header is no longer MIME word encoded. Line breaks and control characters are still removed. \n OTP-Token is included in the DKIM signature by default. \n A Content-ID header, from an attachment cid or set through headers , is now encoded as a message id rather than as text, so a cid with a non-ASCII character or a quote keeps matching the cid: URL in the HTML. \n Groundmail added to the well-known services. \n \n\n Features \n \n add the otp option for the OTP-Token header ( 7789e15 ) \n \n Bug Fixes \n \n encode a Content-ID header as a message id ( #1904 ) ( 47f2b25 ) \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n Assets \n 2 \n \n \n \n \n \n Loading \n \n\n \n \n \n \n \n\n Uh oh!\n \n There was an error while loading. Please reload this page . \n \n\n \n \n \n \n\n \n\n\n \n \n --> \n \n \n ❤️ \n 2 \n maxdzin and Roxaski reacted with heart emoji \n 👀 \n 1 \n maxdzin reacted with eyes emoji \n \n \n \n All reactions \n \n \n\n \n \n ❤️ \n 2 reactions \n \n \n 👀 \n 1 reaction \n \n \n \n \n \n 2 people reacted \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n v10.2.1 \n\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n v10.2.1 \n \n \n \n \n\n \n \n \n\n \n \n \n \n \n\n \n \n \n \n \n \n Compare \n \n \n \n \n \n\n \n \n \n \n \n Choose a tag to compare\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n Sorry, something went wrong. \n \n \n \n \n \n Filter\n \n \n \n \n \n Loading \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n Sorry, something went wrong. \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n\n Uh oh!\n \n There was an error while loading. Please reload this page . \n \n\n \n \n \n \n No results found \n \n \n \n View all tags \n \n \n \n \n\n \n \n\n \n \n \n \n github-actions \n\n released this\n\n \n 22 Oct 13:42\n \n \n\n \n\n\n \n \n \n \n v10.2.1\n \n \n \n \n \n 8dbff1d \n \n \n \n\n \n \n\n \n \n \n \n \n This commit was created on GitHub.com and signed with GitHub’s verified signature .\n \n \n\n\n \n GPG key ID: B5690EEEBB952194 \n \n \n Verified\n \n \n Learn about vigilant mode .\n \n \n \n \n\n \n\n \n \n 10.2.1 (2026-10-22) \n Bug Fixes \n \n drop the comments of a Content-Type or Content-Disposition value with the stripComments option ( b3052b7 ) \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n Assets \n 2 \n \n \n \n \n \n Loading \n \n\n \n \n \n \n \n\n Uh oh!\n \n There was an error while loading. Please reload this page . \n \n\n \n \n \n \n\n \n\n\n \n \n --> \n \n \n \n \n \n All reactions \n \n \n\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n 