 about vigilant mode .\n \n \n \n \n\n \n\n \n \n Overview \n This release adds OCP FP8 E4M3 quantization support, a new flash_attn_ext_rows op that makes the unified KV cache efficient for multi-sequence inference, and a generic batched tensor copy API. Four new architectures are supported (Clover, Limite, Metis-1.6 and Mistral Large 4), audio generation and transcription expand with Chatterbox TTS, Nemotron 3.5 Transcribe and predefined Pocket TTS voices, and the Gemma 4 E2B/E4B models get major prefill optimizations. ggml is updated to v0.29.0, bringing FP8 E4M3, flash attention rows, NCCL-based multi-node tensor parallelism and performance work across the CPU, CUDA, SYCL, Metal, Vulkan, OpenCL and Hexagon backends. The server and UI receive a round of fixes and refinements. \n Highlights \n \n \n Quant: OCP FP8 E4M3 tensor type (saturating mode) with conversion helpers and a new ftype ( #27512 ) \n \n \n llama: flash_attn_ext_rows - more efficient unified KV for multi-seq, restoring non-unified KV prefill performance ( #29510 ) \n \n \n ggml: batched tensor copy API ( ggml_backend_tensor_copy_n / set_n / get_n ) superseding the _2d API, implemented for Metal and CUDA ( #30881 ) \n \n \n For a 3rd year in a row, llama.cpp is a featured repo in the Github Octoverse report : \n \n \n \n API changes \n \n llama.h: add LLAMA_FTYPE_MOSTLY_F8_E4M3 ( #27512 ) \n mtmd.h: add MTMD_GEN_AUDIO_TYPE_CHATTERBOX and n_voices to mtmd_gen_audio_info ( #30993 ) \n mtmd.h: add predefined-voice APIs: mtmd_gen_audio_voice_name() , mtmd_gen_audio_get_voice() , mtmd_gen_state_set_ref() ( #30993 ) \n mtmd.h: add mtmd_bitmap_is_voice() and mtmd_gen_audio_read_tensor() ( #30993 ) \n mtmd.h: add MTMD_VIDEO_TEMPLATE_QWEN3VL video prompt template ( #31619 ) \n server: GET /props reports the model's predefined TTS voices ; the TTS endpoint accepts predefined voice names ( #30993 ) \n server: /v1/responses now merges extra_params (seed, min_p, ...) into the converted chat-completions response ( #30959 ) \n \n New models \n \n Clover-35B-A3B-Preview diffusion model, AR mode ( #31306 ) \n Limite 1B - Violetto ( #29433 ) \n Metis-1.6 (Praxis ~2.9B and Logos ~10.2B): hybrid Mamba-2 / GQA attention with fixed-depth recurrence and LatentMoE ( #31134 ) \n Mistral Large 4 ( #31376 ) \n \n Core changes \n \n gemma4: graph optimizations with massive prefill gains for E2B and E4B ( #31356 ); create token_embd before the tied output in gemma3n and gemma4 ( #31394 ) \n LFM3: enable NVFP4 GGUFs ( #31608 ), enable tensor split ( #31431 ), quantize the audio codec decoder ( #31386 ) \n spec dec: save and restore MTP hidden state in context checkpoints ( #30141 ) and record LFM3 layer inputs ( #31598 ) \n dflash: copy hidden features via device copies ( #31506 ); qwen4exp: write the conv state tail without an intermediate cont ( #31443 ) \n model loading: reuse the tensor staging buffer and skip the direct-IO bounce buffer ( #31321 ) \n kv-cache: keep Hadamard rotation constants on the GPU ( #31073 ) and fix attention tensor rotation in layers with shared KV ( #31406 ) \n kv-cache: never return 0 kv_rows for sequences without cells ( #31570 ) and refuse rollbacks past the snapshots of the last ubatch ( #31368 ) \n Gemma4 MTP assistant: follow ctx_other devices and flash-attention setting ( #31635 ); DSV4: remove simple batch splitting ( #31300 ) \n chat: strip the qwen3-coder think block with reasoning_format none ( #31380 ) and end reasoning budget forcing on a prompt end tag ( #31374 ) \n chat: allow a constraint type after the gpt-oss final channel ( #31556 ); common: fix -hf tag matching inside longer quant names ( #31620 ) and bound control vector layer indices ( #31336 ) \n tools: reject mismatched shards in GGUF split merge ( #31579 ), fix imatrix --nextn crash ( #31522 ), fix gguf-py np_roundf dropping the sign ( #31310 ) \n vendor: miniaudio 0.11.26 ( #31459 ) and cpp-httplib 0.64.0 ( #31400 ); embed an app manifest in all Windows executables ( #31329 ) \n \n Multi-modality changes \n \n add Chatterbox TTS support ( #30993 ) \n add Nemotron 3.5 Transcribe support: offline transcription in 40 languages with prompt context and speaker attribution ( #31471 ) \n Pocket TTS: support predefined voices without voice cloning ( #31429 ) \n accurate support for the qwen3-vl video prompt format ( #31619 ) \n resize Gemma 4 images without letterbox padding ( #30922 ) and fix InternVL CLS token order ( #30886 ) \n \n Server changes \n \n cap shared decision prefixes at the first output ( #30710 ) \n restore the speculative checkpoint for drafts longer than n_rs_seq ( #31350 ) \n \n UI changes \n \n add MCP group checkboxes in the tools settings ( #31303 ) and request persistent storage on startup ( #31299 ) \n keep chats at the bottom until the reader scrolls up ( #31311 ) and show the submit button when the input has content ( #31324 ) \n reveal the collapsed sidebar from its logo ( #31307 ) and align alert dialog styling ( #31312 ) \n keep queued steering messages in their own conversation ( #31304 ) and show an interrupted state for tool calls that never returned ( #31314 ) \n disable model deletion the server would refuse ( #31305 ) and prefer a loading model in pre-selection ( #31326 ) \n add a Playwright harness for recording demo videos ( #31318 ) and run local browser tests in installed Chrome ( #31596 ) \n \n ggml changes \n \n v0.29.0 : ggml v0.29.0 adds an OCP FP8 E4M3 tensor type, a new ggml_flash_attn_ext_rows op where each query slice attends to its own list of K/V rows, a batched tensor copy API, and initial support for multi-node tensor parallelism through a new multi-process communicator interface. Core improvements include bounding tensor views by the bytes their strides reach, zero-copy GGUF export of host-buffer tensors, and vm_allocate -based allocations on Apple platforms. Performance work spans all major backends: new SVE kernels in the CPU backend, DPAS flash attention for quantized KV in SYCL, fused MoE MMQ in CUDA, faster MXFP4 mat-vec in Metal, split-K tuning in Vulkan, and a large expansion of quantized GEMM/GEMV coverage in OpenCL. The Hexagon backend gains support for several new ops, including the lightning indexer, top-k mask, conv2d and upscale. \n \n Assets \n Nightly build: b12110 \n More info \n \n Releases and versioning of ggml-org projects \n \n Changelog since v0.8.0 \n cd959ba llama.cpp : bump version to 0.9.0 ( #31646 ) \n 13ec8f6 sync : ggml \n cca14f6 ggml : bump version to 0.29.0 (ggml/1680) \n e853ec9 llama : follow ctx_other devices and flash attention in Gemma4 assistant ( #31635 ) \n feaf800 ggml : Gate RVV code on the target extension ( #31607 ) \n 4c4ca5b common : do not allow _ in sidecar ( #31639 ) \n 162e2bb ggml : fix bf16 ( #31609 ) \n 6900fb5 opencl: improve q2_0 GEMV for Adreno ( #31577 ) \n bbb02c9 ggml: bound views by the bytes their strides reach ( #31584 ) \n 960b1d5 ggml : write host-buffer tensor data directly in gguf writer ( #31144 ) \n 4b29d02 common : fix -hf tag matching inside longer quant names ( #31620 ) \n bee2332 hexagon: add LIGHTNING_INDEXER support ( #31289 ) \n 149f564 mtmd: accurate support for qwen3-vl video prompt format ( #31619 ) \n b976279 model, mtmd: add chatterbox TTS support ( #30993 ) \n 7071ba3 hexagon: add TOP_K_MASK op ( #31552 ) \n 6cb3e67 gemma4: graph optimizations (massive gains on pp for E2B and E4B) ( #31356 ) \n 6b9c0cf hexagon: faster TOP_K for the backend sampler ( #31279 ) \n d1c4e5b ui: run local browser tests in installed Chrome with its sandbox on ( #31596 ) \n 20a51f2 hexagon: add DSV4_HC_PRE and DSV4_HC_POST ops ( #30953 ) \n 0f35d6d spec : save and restore MTP hidden state ( #30141 ) \n a464960 ggml-zdnn: fix fattn test failure ( #31583 ) \n 9309bf1 model : Add support for Metis-1.6 models ( #31134 ) \n d1044bc model : enable NVFP4 LFM3 ggufs ( #31608 ) \n 28b812d mtmd : add Nemotron 3.5 Transcribe support ( #31471 ) \n 749db7f qwen4exp: write the conv state tail without an intermediate cont ( #31443 ) \n 0943ca5 ui: add Playwright harness for recording demo videos ( #31318 ) \n f9448cd model : record layer inputs in LFM3 for spec dec ( #31598 ) \n 0978a6e ggml: avoid signed overflow in ggml_roll bounds check ( #30375 ) \n 0ef2730 conversion : use original model tensor names in _flush_nvfp4_experts ( #31427 ) \n 8fc0376 cuda: potential fix for Q8_1 correction sum ( #31247 ) \n 740251a cuda : gather batched tensor reads into mapped host memory (PR to master) ( #31391 ) \n 71efc55 Add nccl support for multi-node tensor parallelism ( #28967 ) \n 19e8a86 tools : reject mismatched shards in GGUF split merge ( #31579 ) \n 259d917 meta: support GLM-5.3 next sm tensor ( #30499 ) \n 36ee3ca metal : fix cpy kernel for dst non-contiguous in dim 0 ( #31581 ) \n fac3a89 vulkan: skip maxStorageBufferRange pre-check for non-compute tensors ( #31114 ) \n b74298c delta_net_base: refactor conv state ( #30878 ) \n 37b0f9c vulkan: fix out-of-bounds NVFP4 UE4M3 scale lookup ( #31079 ) \n ca8daad llama : drop the redundant cnv from llm_attn_mask ( #31558 ) \n 0f663d2 dsv4.1: fix llama-context tests with partial offload ( #31292 ) \n 00f113e cuda : prevent premature eviction of graphs about to be used ( #30662 ) \n e6192de opencl: add initial iq4_xs support ( #31339 ) \n 4402e65 chat : allow constraint type after gpt-oss final channel ( #31556 ) \n 74101b3 ci : update the HIP VGPR spill ignore list for the kv_rows FA kernel argument ( #31550 ) \n 713319e webgpu: add ARANGE support ( #31455 ) \n ee17f29 kv-cache : never return 0 kv_rows for sequences without cells ( #31570 ) \n 51fe42c hexagon: tiled hvx permute ( #31446 ) \n 2cbca38 dflash: copy hidden features via device copies ( #31506 ) \n 29c720e docs: update s390x build docs ( #31546 ) \n d02b4c0 mtmd: Pocket tts - support for voices without voice cloning ( #31429 ) \n e4b6c8c model: add Clover support ( #31306 ) \n 1b6935b llama : flash_attn_ext_rows - more efficient unified kv for multi-seq ( #29510 ) \n 3f8af15 imat