as created on GitHub.com and signed with GitHub’s verified signature .\n \n \n\n\n \n GPG key ID: B5690EEEBB952194 \n \n \n Verified\n \n \n Learn about vigilant mode .\n \n \n \n \n\n \n\n \n \n ⚠️ Upgrade notes \n \n GitHub polling needs an allowlist. New host-only github.polling_repositories = [\"owner/repo\", ...] ; empty (the default) ignores every notification, so polling deployments must set it ( #4294 ). \n Jira project_keys = [] now disables lookups. The default is now [\"*\"] . If you set [] to mean \"all projects\", change it to [\"*\"] or remove it ( #4049 ). \n litellm.extra_headers is host-only. Repository .pr_agent.toml and comment arguments can no longer set it ( #4287 ). \n Default model is now gpt-6.1-sol with gpt-6-luna as fallback (was gpt-5.6 / gpt-5.6-terra ). Pin config.model to keep the old one ( #4088 ). \n Langfuse SDK 4.18.0 needs self-hosted Langfuse 3.63.0+; use the langfuse_otel callback ( #4343 ). \n GitHub App token in Actions: set github.agent_login to <app-slug>[bot] so PR-Agent recognises its own comments ( #4329 ). \n \n ✨ Highlights \n \n pr-agent doctor preflights a deployment ( #4321 ). \n --json-output for /describe , /improve and /review ( #4265 , #4227 , #4226 ). \n Jira scoped API tokens ( #4250 ), /ask with the CI artifact as context ( #4176 ), globs in repo_context_files ( #4220 ), opt-in GitLab subgroup settings inheritance ( #4059 ). \n Security hardening: DNS rebinding block, repo-context path escapes, host-only config output, loguru diagnose off, more credential redaction ( #4252 , #4279 , #4293 , #4280 , #4328 ). \n \n What's Changed \n \n Redact Stripe, Twilio and SendGrid credentials by @IlyaKhalafi in #4328 \n ci(review): make self-hosted /improve post suggestions again by @Yoel-qin in #4174 \n Enable automatic /review on new PRs (fixes #4162 ) by @kiranmutyala18 in #4170 \n \n 🚀 Features \n \n feat(artifacts): support multiple artifact files by @utsab345 in #4338 \n feat(cli): add a doctor command to preflight the deployment by @Yoel-qin in #4321 \n feat(describe): write the description to --json-output by @Yoel-qin in #4265 \n feat(jira): support scoped API tokens by @utsab345 in #4250 \n feat(repo-context): glob entries and fallback alternatives in repo_context_files by @ira-at-work in #4220 \n feat(ask): include organizational skills in line-level answers by @Yoel-qin in #4225 \n feat(review): list the files left out in the JSON output by @Sajinthan in #4226 \n feat(improve): write suggestions to --json-output by @Sajinthan in #4227 \n feat(ask): answer questions with the CI artifact as context by @Yoel-qin in #4176 \n feat(help): prioritize a matching document in constrained prompts by @oleksii-tumanov in #4101 \n feat(gitlab): add opt-in closest-subgroup settings inheritance by @ashearin in #4059 \n feat(improve): retain equal summaries across files by @oleksii-tumanov in #4128 \n \n 🐛 Bug Fixes \n \n fix(ask_line): defer handler setup until a diff hunk matches by @oleksii-tumanov in #4354 \n fix(mosaico): retain tasks with bounded owner history by @utsab345 in #4337 \n fix(add-docs): retry malformed model responses with fallback models by @PeterDaveHello in #4346 \n fix(routing): count diff hunks without splitting patch lines by @PeterDaveHello in #4344 \n fix: retry whitespace-only model completions by @PeterDaveHello in #4348 \n fix(azure): reject incomplete linked work item responses by @oleksii-tumanov in #4173 \n fix(algo): prefer exact source lines before fuzzy matching by @PeterDaveHello in #4340 \n fix(similar_issue): use the supported Qdrant query API by @PeterDaveHello in #4341 \n fix(azure): handle created events without a web link by @oleksii-tumanov in #4171 \n fix(ask): answer with a note when every changed file is filtered out by @sarankumar1325 in #4336 \n fix(gitlab): paginate repository directory listings by @utsab345 in #4332 \n fix(github): let the operator name the agent login an app token posts as by @sarankumar1325 in #4329 \n fix: reject boolean routing limits by @utsab345 in #4302 \n fix: parse GitLab boolean settings by @utsab345 in #4303 \n fix: stop Gitea changed-files pagination at the advertised total by @fixfon in #4306 \n fix(describe): retain valid YAML file-description chunks by @PeterDaveHello in #4315 \n fix(gitlab): preserve Git line boundaries when resolving fixed threads by @PeterDaveHello in #4313 \n fix(improve): keep embedded fences inside summary diffs by @PeterDaveHello in #4312 \n fix: skip generate_labels, add_docs and update_changelog when all files are filtered by @swayamg20 in #4307 \n fix(help_docs): preserve fenced examples during cleanup by @PeterDaveHello in #4319 \n fix: reject boolean body size limits by @utsab345 in #4301 \n fix: normalize list settings consistently by @utsab345 in #4300 \n fix: restrict polling to allowlisted repositories by @utsab345 in #4294 \n fix: hide host-only configuration output by @utsab345 in #4293 \n fix: anchor incremental reviews to agent comments by @utsab345 in #4292 \n fix: require bot authorship for describe persistent comments by @utsab345 in #4291 \n fix: authorize cross-project GitLab tickets by @utsab345 in #4290 \n fix(config): keep litellm.extra_headers host-only by @fixfon in #4287 \n fix: disable loguru diagnose and backtrace by @utsab345 in #4280 \n fix: reject escaping repo context paths by @utsab345 in #4279 \n fix(github): use the GraphQL endpoint on GitHub Enterprise Server by @MaxFreedomPollard in #4272 \n fix(help_docs): preserve ranked documents that already fit by @PeterDaveHello in #4267 \n fix(review): preserve source characters in patch-based snippets by @PeterDaveHello in #4268 \n fix(review): resolve findings in a chunked review when none were cut by @jadhavgaurav in #4222 \n fix(config): honor settings context selection by @utsab345 in #4251 \n fix(ci): update uv security pin by @utsab345 in #4263 \n fix(ignore): keep bracket expressions in string glob patterns by @utsab345 in #4245 \n fix(skills): treat a string paths value as one path by @utsab345 in #4244 \n fix: parse CRLF plain diffs correctly by @strawberry-little-bear in #4231 \n fix(ignore): cap glob length by @utsab345 in #4259 \n fix: treat scalar PR ignore settings as single values by @kocaemre in #4257 \n fix(security): block DNS rebinding by @utsab345 in #4252 \n fix: normalize scalar PR commands by @utsab345 in #4253 \n fix(bitbucket): read ambiguous diff headers from patch metadata by @utsab345 in #4248 \n fix(outputs): deliver the sinks off the event loop by @utsab345 in #4247 \n fix(polling): avoid rerunning commands found in comment history by @PeterDaveHello in #4239 \n fix(gitlab): publish notice for incomplete merge request diffs by @Evhye38496 in #4234 \n fix(help): render static help without initializing an AI handler by @PeterDaveHello in #4241 \n fix(labels): preserve label changes made during model calls by @PeterDaveHello in #4237 \n fix(bedrock): stop sending temperature to GLM-5 by default by @ira-at-work in #4219 \n fix(repo-context): survive a failed revision lookup by @utsab345 in #4246 \n fix(algo): keep yaml fence stripping linear by @utsab345 in #4232 \n fix: stop bare #N in comments, link text, colours and words becoming tickets by @jay23606 in #4198 \n fix: prevent local config contents in log artifact while preserving PR comment by @wjc2821296948 in #4197 \n fix(describe): fall back on unusable model responses by @PeterDaveHello in #4186 \n fix(gitlab): avoid double-encoding submodule project paths by @PeterDaveHello in #4214 \n fix(changelog): retry empty model responses before publishing by @PeterDaveHello in #4209 \n fix(help_docs): recognize Unicode letters in documentation by @PeterDaveHello in #4206 \n fix: skip review and describe when all files are filtered by @utsab345 in #4204 \n fix(help_docs): recount tokens after cleaning documentation by @PeterDaveHello in #4188 \n fix(review): preserve case-sensitive paths when merging chunks by @PeterDaveHello in #4182 \n fix(gerrit): bound direct git and SSH commands by @oleksii-tumanov in #4177 \n fix(plain-diff): decode Git-quoted file paths by @Aling33 in #4152 \n fix(add_docs): preserve literal indentation in suggestions by @oleksii-tumanov in #4172 \n fix(review): preserve corrected answers for the latest question by @PeterDaveHello in #4166 \n fix(models): avoid same-model retries for authentication failures by @PeterDaveHello in #4167 \n fix(diff): preserve non-LF characters when rebuilding patches by @PeterDaveHello in #4168 \n fix(gitlab): pin repository settings to one revision by @oleksii-tumanov in #4093 \n fix: require Bitbucket Server diff content by @utsab345 in #4111 \n fix(github): read repository settings from one revision by @oleksii-tumanov in #4094 \n fix(gitlab): retry not-ready merge request diffs with bounded backoff by @Yoel-qin in #4150 \n fix: align Bitbucket patches by file path by @utsab345 in #4102 \n fix(diff): split patches on newlines only so line numbers match git by @porkedchop in #4080 \n fix(ask): parse markdown image URLs precisely by @utsab345 in #4087 \n fix(review): merge chunked ticket entries by the real ticket by @utsab345 in #4139 \n fix(jira): default project_keys to wildcard and empty list to disable lookups ( #3887 ) by @itsvrushabh in #4049 \n fix(routing): retain displaced primary in colliding fallback chains by @PeterDaveHello in #4064 \n fix(bitbucket): encode file paths in content reads by @utsab345 in #4095 \n fix: preserve repeated override quote types by @utsab345 in #4129 \n fix(review): cap merged chunk findings at num_max_findings by @utsab345 in #4138 \n fix: keep quoted list settings as lists in parse_command by @utsab345 in #4070 \n fix(github): scope API-URL classification to exact host + path prefix by @depohmel in #4143 \n fix(github): refresh all PR label pages before replacement by @PeterDaveHello in #4083 \n fix: discard stale plain diff context by @utsab345 in #4114 \n fix: honor ignore rules in local diff providers by @utsab345 in #4110 \n fix(gitea): skip inline comments on lines outside the diff by @fbidu in #4130 \n fix(gitea): read renamed base from old path by @utsab345 in #4132 \n fix(gitea): encode raw file content paths by @jiuyueQ in #4106 \n fix: include DNS validation in URL fetch timeouts by @oleksii-tumanov in #4109 \n fix(diff): bound context at adjacent hunks by @utsab345 in #4086 \n fix(diff): decode UTF-16 file content correctly by @utsab345 in #4096 \n fix(describe): preserve success when final feedback fails by @oleksii-tumanov in #4092 \n fix(describe): skip file walkthrough entries with empty fields by @utsab345 in #4082 \n fix(codecommit): report unreadable changed files by @utsab345 in #4133 \n fix: avoid partial Azure incremental reviews by @utsab345 in #4099 \n fix(bitbucket): prevent fork changelog writes by @utsab345 in #4098 \n fix(gitlab): match ticket URLs to the configured origin by @oleksii-tumanov in #4097 \n fix(similar_issue): retry after filtering excluded hits by @oleksii-tumanov in #4104 \n fix: avoid invented GitLab file changes by @utsab345 in #4100 \n \n ⚡ Performance \n \n perf(bitbucket): reuse the initial diffstat result by @oleksii-tumanov in #4356 \n perf(github): avoid refetching inline question thread comments by @PeterDaveHello in #4345 \n perf: defer unused per-file extended diff token counts by @PeterDaveHello in #4349 \n perf(similar_issue): batch indexed issue lookups by @PeterDaveHello in #4339 \n perf(gitlab): fetch incremental commits in larger pages by @PeterDaveHello in #4318 \n perf(diff): release discarded extended patches before repacking by @PeterDaveHello in #4317 \n perf(gitlab): load submodule mappings only for expandable changes by @PeterDaveHello in #4314 \n perf(github): reuse revision-pinned configuration tree paths by @PeterDaveHello in #4311 \n perf(context): expand repository globs only within the line budget by @PeterDaveHello in #4310 \n perf(gitlab): reuse revision-pinned configuration tree paths by @PeterDaveHello in #