nation during indexing by @PeterDaveHello in #4169 \n perf(gitlab): reduce pagination requests for commit messages by @PeterDaveHello in #4164 \n perf(gitlab): avoid project fetch before language stats by @PeterDaveHello in #4163 \n perf(github): fetch issue sub-issues in one GraphQL request by @PeterDaveHello in #4157 \n perf(ask_line): avoid full PR reads for language logging by @PeterDaveHello in #4156 \n perf: defer Gitea diff and commit fetches by @utsab345 in #4103 \n perf(improve): avoid truncation work for required suggestion chunks by @PeterDaveHello in #4146 \n perf(config): reuse remote extra config payloads per request by @PeterDaveHello in #4043 \n perf(codecommit): cache completed empty file lists by @oleksii-tumanov in #4127 \n perf(bitbucket): avoid unused Server base lookups by @oleksii-tumanov in #4108 \n perf: batch LanceDB issue index checks by @utsab345 in #4115 \n perf(gitlab): cache verified empty diff results by @PeterDaveHello in #4085 \n perf(github): limit thread lookup to root comments by @PeterDaveHello in #4113 \n perf(github): filter check-run lookups by name by @PeterDaveHello in #4112 \n perf(github): reuse command provider for polling reactions by @PeterDaveHello in #4084 \n perf(gitlab): skip fetching MR commits without an incremental anchor by @PeterDaveHello in #4147 \n \n 📚 Documentation \n \n docs: clarify setup steps and section hierarchy across guides by @PeterDaveHello in #4342 \n docs: clarify the uv version requirement in CONTRIBUTING.md by @PeterDaveHello in #4308 \n docs: add review checklist by @utsab345 in #4298 \n docs: add \"Incorrect API key provided: dummy_key\" to the GitHub Action troubleshooting list by @qwist1233-cpu in #4199 \n docs: stop examples from repeating the primary model in fallback_models by @utsab345 in #4205 \n docs: Scope agent lint fixes to changed files and preserve valid ignores by @PeterDaveHello in #4159 \n docs: add API Route configuration example by @DennyHo0917 in #4153 \n docs: Align AGEN